{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__dsh-fleet-audit#card-zh","repo":"YaoleWu/dsh-fleet-audit","commit":"ea36c49c33798a460478f07d11654149e59a7b1c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet-audit 是接入 DSH 工具层的本机检查插件，通过 `fleet_audit` 工具检查常见凭据文件和 Git 配置。它读取常用 home 文件及用户提供的额外文件，报告文件存在状态和权限；也可按 roots 递归发现 `.git/config`，汇总 remote URL 中的凭据并将 URL 凭据掩码，还能统计配置中常见 provider token 前缀。调用者可设置扫描目录、最大配置数、递归深度，并关闭前缀统计。适合在 DSH 会话中查看本机及多个项目的配置检查摘要。插件需要本机文件访问，不要求 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:5-43","lib/audit.js:92-146"]}
{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__dsh-fleet-audit#card-en","repo":"YaoleWu/dsh-fleet-audit","commit":"ea36c49c33798a460478f07d11654149e59a7b1c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Fleet Audit adds `fleet_audit` to DSH. It checks credential-file modes and scans Git configs for credential-bearing remotes, reporting masked URLs and provider-prefix counts. Roots, limits, depth, and prefix scanning are configurable. It uses local files and needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:5-43","lib/audit.js:92-146"]}
