{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__dsh-fleet-audit#feature-1","repo":"YaoleWu/dsh-fleet-audit","commit":"ea36c49c33798a460478f07d11654149e59a7b1c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet-audit 的功能「凭据文件权限检查」：检查常见 home 凭据文件和额外指定路径的权限，返回文件是否存在、权限模式及是否过宽。调用 `fleet_audit` 时执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/audit.js:9-10","lib/audit.js:19-31","lib/audit.js:105-110"]}
{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__dsh-fleet-audit#feature-2","repo":"YaoleWu/dsh-fleet-audit","commit":"ea36c49c33798a460478f07d11654149e59a7b1c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet-audit 的功能「Git remote 凭据扫描」：从 home Git 配置和 roots 下找到的仓库配置中识别 remote URL 凭据，并输出对应文件、主机和掩码 URL。调用时提供 roots。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/audit.js:33-90","lib/audit.js:111-123","lib/secret.js:34-49"]}
{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__dsh-fleet-audit#feature-3","repo":"YaoleWu/dsh-fleet-audit","commit":"ea36c49c33798a460478f07d11654149e59a7b1c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet-audit 的功能「provider 前缀计数」：可在发现的 Git 配置文本中匹配常见 provider token 前缀，并返回各类别的出现次数。通过 `scanSecrets` 参数控制是否启用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/secret.js:6-25","lib/audit.js:102-104","lib/audit.js:123-127"]}
{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__dsh-fleet-audit#feature-4","repo":"YaoleWu/dsh-fleet-audit","commit":"ea36c49c33798a460478f07d11654149e59a7b1c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet-audit 的功能「有界目录扫描」：调用者可设置 roots、最大 Git 配置数和递归深度；插件按这些参数发现 `.git/config`，并在结果中汇总检查数量。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:13-35","lib/audit.js:12-14","lib/audit.js:33-69","lib/audit.js:103-104","lib/audit.js:142-145"]}
{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__dsh-fleet-audit#caveat-1","repo":"YaoleWu/dsh-fleet-audit","commit":"ea36c49c33798a460478f07d11654149e59a7b1c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet-audit 使用额外指定的 files 检查权限；provider 前缀计数只处理发现的 Git 配置文本，不会扫描这些额外文件的内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/audit.js:100-125"]}
